text:
Note that $a$ is the $i$th element of~$s$ iff $p_i^{a+1}$ is
the largest power of~$p_i$ that divides~$s$, i.e., $p_i^{a+1} \mid s$
but $p_i^{a+2} \nmid s$. So:
  \[
  \fn{element}(s,i) =
  \begin{cases}
    0 & \mbox{if $i \geq \len{s}$} \\
    \bmin{a < s}{(p_i^{a+2} \nmid s)} & \text{otherwise.}
  \end{cases}
  \]
